      "subclasses": [
        {
          "key": "archfey-patron",
          "name": "Archfey Patron",
          "description": "<p>Bargain with whimsical Fey. Your pact draws on the power of the Feywild. You might make a deal with an archfey, such as the Prince of Frost; the Queen of Air and Darkness, ruler of the Gloaming Court; Titania of the Summer Court; or an ancient hag. Whoever they are, your patron is often inscrutable and whimsical.</p>",
          "features": [
            {
              "key": "archfey-patron.archfey-spells",
              "name": "Archfey Spells",
              "level": 3,
              "description": "<p>The magic of your patron ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Warlock level specified in the Archfey Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><table><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Calm Emotions, Faerie Fire, Misty Step, Phantasmal Force, Sleep</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Blink, Plant Growth</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dominate Beast, Greater Invisibility</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Dominate Person, Seeming</td></tr></table>",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "target": "spell.calm-emotions",
                  "op": "Grant",
                  "value": "1",
                  "condition": "classLevel('warlock') >= 3",
                  "label": "Archfey Spells"
                },
                {
                  "target": "spell.faerie-fire",
                  "op": "Grant",
